            "detailed_description": "What would you do on a night such as this?<br />\r\nWould you cook dinner? Watch a little TV? Play a few video games? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat if you were Eddy Denado? What if you were having a peaceful, quiet night, and all of a sudden it all changed? What if the trail of broken glass and muddy footprints led you to an uncomfortable realization? What if you weren't alone?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomeone has turned your Humble Abode into anything but. Now it's time to survive. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Puzzle solving requires you to rely on the brute force of your brain.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- More than one ending, encouraging different approaches to your playthrough.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Your own home becomes a dread-filled nightmare!",
